{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":489459,"name":"Alex","username":"a7u","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/a/d9b06d/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-12T10:21:57.892Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489459-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489459-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489459-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489459-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf I leave Grok Bot app shortly after I receive a response, I still get an iOS or Mac notification, as if the app didn’t register that I’ve already read the response.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI often click the notification thinking Grok sent another subsequent message, but there’s nothing new there, the notification is for my last read message.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489459-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489459-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType a prompt and receive its answer.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLeave the app within 3-5 seconds*.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e*could be more; it’s often after enough time to skim the response. I’m not being nitpicky, this actually happens to me with normal use.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489459-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489459-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf a message was read and I leave the Grok Bot app, no notification should ensue.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489459-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489459-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003cbr\u003e\niOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489459-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489459-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot MacOS: 0.47.0\u003cbr\u003e\nGrok Bot iOS (iPhone): 1.8.0\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-489459-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-489459-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2026-09-12T10:22:05.292Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":3,"reads":2,"readers_count":1,"score":15.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":171420,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-app-still-sends-notification-if-i-leave-app-shortly-after-response","display_username":"Alex","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":126684,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-app-still-sends-notification-if-i-leave-app-shortly-after-response/171420/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false